    <comment>New package: GreenLiT 3.1.1, NVIDIA's test framework for Linux distributions on NVIDIA platforms. Its generic top-level Python modules live in /usr/share/greenlit; the Legal-Review-Notice covers the GPL test sources built on the target. Slowroll i586 is unresolvable project-wide.</comment>
